;@ The Pikachu fan: brags about his Pikachu (and makes the Seel fan want to brag next) - or, after the Seel
;@ fan bragged, insists his is better.
;@ test: skip a text script: the code after text_asm is run by the text engine
PokemonFanClubPikachuFanText:
	db TX_START_ASM
;> if event(EVENT_PIKACHU_FAN_BOAST):
	ld a, [wEventFlags + $2A]
	bit (EVENT_PIKACHU_FAN_BOAST) % 8, a
	jr nz, .mineisbetter
;>@e1     PrintText(PokemonFanClubPikachuFanText.BetterText)
