SSAnneCaptainsRoomCaptainIFeelMuchBetterText:
	db TX_FAR
	dw _SSAnneCaptainsRoomCaptainIFeelMuchBetterText
	db BANK(_SSAnneCaptainsRoomCaptainIFeelMuchBetterText)
